 "timestamp": "01:09:54", "text": "いい感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4196.47, "timestamp": "01:09:56", "text": "そして、もしあなたが望むなら、もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4199.99, "timestamp": "01:09:59", "text": "歩き回りたい"}]